    "name": "Spellsided",
    "steam_appid": 3088510,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spellsided is a <strong>turn-based single-player RPG</strong> that comes with a <strong>new, puzzling twist on deck-builders</strong> - it\u2019s a dice-builder!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Discord community and follow us on YouTube via the links in the sidebar to stay up to date with development!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/441535a622831a1f36c81a72eb904f24.poster.avif?t=1750757272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/441535a622831a1f36c81a72eb904f24.webm?t=1750757272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/441535a622831a1f36c81a72eb904f24.mp4?t=1750757272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER SPELLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a fully-customisable magical die named Hex, who has been discarded by the Gods of the Tabletop. Cast your spells with every step as you <strong>navigate a fantasy world</strong> of toppling dominoes, warring chess pieces, and conniving cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/ceecbe69e5709eb2634151614509072d.poster.avif?t=1750757272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/ceecbe69e5709eb2634151614509072d.webm?t=1750757272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/ceecbe69e5709eb2634151614509072d.mp4?t=1750757272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s <strong>no correct way to solve a puzzle</strong>. Find your personal style and let your imagination run wild with the variety of loadouts and combos available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/5a87d861ddf7d0f474d4f56d5542d9e1.avif?t=1750757272\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character has their own <strong>complex history with the Gods</strong>, either <strong>struggling to find purpose</strong>, or struggling with the purpose they\u2019ve been given. In your journey of return, you may be able to help these lost pieces... if they let you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/782d6091b74f119d0ff125eb93abcd07.avif?t=1750757272\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong>dozens of tricky foes</strong>, including <strong>the Dustmancer</strong>, a fallen warrior who has turned to the heretical worship of dust, revelling in godlessness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/6c14365496f8d7a6d0c906f6ff45603a.avif?t=1750757272\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEAT SCORES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in various challenge rooms placed around the world. <strong>Compare your move count</strong> with your friends and compete to finish in the <strong>lowest moves!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/50e75124f9c0a0773a2d83a08018af2e.poster.avif?t=1750757272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/50e75124f9c0a0773a2d83a08018af2e.webm?t=1750757272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/50e75124f9c0a0773a2d83a08018af2e.mp4?t=1750757272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IN A HAND-CRAFTED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a <strong>hand-made voxel fantasy realm</strong>, with stop-motion animations created frame-by-frame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/f3fe6aa86cb82e12b76e85e01284efa9.avif?t=1750757272\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spellsided is a <strong>turn-based single-player RPG</strong> that comes with a <strong>new, puzzling twist on deck-builders</strong> - it\u2019s a dice-builder!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Discord community and follow us on YouTube via the links in the sidebar to stay up to date with development!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/441535a622831a1f36c81a72eb904f24.poster.avif?t=1750757272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/441535a622831a1f36c81a72eb904f24.webm?t=1750757272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/441535a622831a1f36c81a72eb904f24.mp4?t=1750757272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER SPELLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a fully-customisable magical die named Hex, who has been discarded by the Gods of the Tabletop. Cast your spells with every step as you <strong>navigate a fantasy world</strong> of toppling dominoes, warring chess pieces, and conniving cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/ceecbe69e5709eb2634151614509072d.poster.avif?t=1750757272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/ceecbe69e5709eb2634151614509072d.webm?t=1750757272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/ceecbe69e5709eb2634151614509072d.mp4?t=1750757272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s <strong>no correct way to solve a puzzle</strong>. Find your personal style and let your imagination run wild with the variety of loadouts and combos available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/5a87d861ddf7d0f474d4f56d5542d9e1.avif?t=1750757272\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character has their own <strong>complex history with the Gods</strong>, either <strong>struggling to find purpose</strong>, or struggling with the purpose they\u2019ve been given. In your journey of return, you may be able to help these lost pieces... if they let you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/782d6091b74f119d0ff125eb93abcd07.avif?t=1750757272\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong>dozens of tricky foes</strong>, including <strong>the Dustmancer</strong>, a fallen warrior who has turned to the heretical worship of dust, revelling in godlessness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/6c14365496f8d7a6d0c906f6ff45603a.avif?t=1750757272\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEAT SCORES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in various challenge rooms placed around the world. <strong>Compare your move count</strong> with your friends and compete to finish in the <strong>lowest moves!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/50e75124f9c0a0773a2d83a08018af2e.poster.avif?t=1750757272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/50e75124f9c0a0773a2d83a08018af2e.webm?t=1750757272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/50e75124f9c0a0773a2d83a08018af2e.mp4?t=1750757272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IN A HAND-CRAFTED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a <strong>hand-made voxel fantasy realm</strong>, with stop-motion animations created frame-by-frame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088510/extras/f3fe6aa86cb82e12b76e85e01284efa9.avif?t=1750757272\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Play as a magical die in this \u2018dice-builder\u2019 RPG where each of your faces casts a different spell! Discover and combine new spells as you explore a world of eccentric animate board game tokens, all fighting for the affections of the Gods of the Tabletop...",
